reliable3 §1 limit-slot + loud-confirmation gate (deterministic, in-process).
scale: limit=2000 heldSlots=2000 newReady=5000 (all new ready jobs must be skipped).
Gate: scheduled == 0 AND skipped == 5000; the cannot-confirm warning present, naming the
host and pid; and where LSF is usable, the unreadable-private-key warning naming the path.
A MISSING measurement is a FAIL, not a PASS; a skipped facet is reported as unmeasured.
  A limit group whose slots are all held skips every new ready job ✔✔✔    reliable3_repro_test.go:312: LIMIT-STALL-REPRO: limit=2000 heldSlots=2000 newReady=5000 => scheduled=0 skipped=5000
